w that there is only one  right answer to that question a system  in which they have to persuade us  to put aside those rights temporarily  because something necessitates it is the  only tolerable system one in which they  are empowered to decide when we are in  that situation is one that is  automatically going to be abused uh  until we until we uh until we change  [Music]  you

